; The font-size SSOT for the whole game (issue #1224). ONE number, below.
;
; Registered as the PROJECT theme (gui/theme/custom in project.godot), which is
; the bottom of Godot's theme lookup chain, so it reaches every Control -- incl.
; main.tscn, which sets no theme, and the panels built in code with no .tscn.
;
; Font sizes ONLY. No colours, no styleboxes, no fonts. menu_theme.tres sits
; above this for the nine menu scenes and contributes styling only.
;
; Reasoning, the measured evidence, and what this CANNOT reach:
; tools/check_font_sizes.py -- and it counts what is left, on every commit.
;
; NOTE: the Godot editor strips comments when it re-saves a .tres. If this block
; is gone, it went that way; the tool above is the copy that survives.

[gd_resource type="Theme" format=3 uid="uid://dbasethemepd001"]

